==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|ballista||a military siege engine for throwing stones|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bəˈlɪst.ɪk/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{not comparable}} Or relating to [[ballistics]].
# {{comparable}} Or relating to [[projectile]]s moving under their own [[momentum]], air drag, [[gravity]] and sometimes [[rocket]] power
# {{comparable|slang}} Very [[angry]].
#: ''When he heard him lie about it, he went '''ballistic'''.''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|ballistical}}

